    IF `the defendant requires that a question or issue be determined` AND `the question or issue relates to or is connected with the original subject matter of the action` AND `it is to be determined as between either or both of the claimant and the defendant and a person not already a party to the action as well as between the claimant and the defendant`
    THEN JUST TRUE
