    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "as from the time of service"; the answer is a moment, which cannot carry JUST FALSE, and the yes/no twin `o 10 r 1(3) the person is a third party` answers JUST FALSE before service (ruling of 2026-11-05, (b))

